MODULE: CallerOnlyAfterTerminalsBeforeCheckpoint
TARGET: CallerOnlyAfterTerminals
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Caller acknowledgement precedes the completion checkpoint's durable result.
PERTURBS: TerminalOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Terminal \/ Checkpoint \/ Complete \/ TerminalIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: return to the original caller while completion storage is outstanding.
    /\ (Terminal \/ Checkpoint \/ Complete \/ TerminalIdle
        \/ (saga = "completing" /\ saga' = "idle" /\ completed' = TRUE
            /\ UNCHANGED <<drained, materialised, checkpointed, terminalWitness>>))
--- END
